    "detailed_description": "The Tower of the Spells is an RPG inspired by the world of the novel The Order of Dragon Slayers 1, The Muteki Temple by Ra\u00fal Pozo. Accompany Samuel Critchlow during his student years at the magic academy The Tower of Spells.<br><br>Explore the kingdoms of the Margrast continent and discover their secrets.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2503470/extras/0220738953859d437f752935bca27ba5.avif?t=1689889583\" /></span><br><br>Learn new skills and improve your attributes by designing your own combat style.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2503470/extras/f777230488aa4e9ea9190d39014367ae.avif?t=1689889583\" /></span><br><br>Collect resources to improve your equipment.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2503470/extras/6c507e4d5ba6f7c7247f2d38b7d82022.avif?t=1689889583\" /></span><br><br><strong>Key features:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>8-10 hours of gameplay.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Main story divided into 8 chapters.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>8 kingdoms to explore.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Quick turn-based battles.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>There are no random encounters. Enemies are always visible.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Resources can be collected.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Objects can be created.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Teacher System.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>100 spells to learn.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>100 weapons to discover.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>40 armors to discover.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>150 recipes to learn.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>7 professions to learn.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "The Tower of the Spells is an RPG inspired by the world of the novel The Order of Dragon Slayers 1, The Muteki Temple by Ra\u00fal Pozo. Accompany Samuel Critchlow during his student years at the magic academy The Tower of Spells.<br><br>Explore the kingdoms of the Margrast continent and discover their secrets.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2503470/extras/0220738953859d437f752935bca27ba5.avif?t=1689889583\" /></span><br><br>Learn new skills and improve your attributes by designing your own combat style.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2503470/extras/f777230488aa4e9ea9190d39014367ae.avif?t=1689889583\" /></span><br><br>Collect resources to improve your equipment.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2503470/extras/6c507e4d5ba6f7c7247f2d38b7d82022.avif?t=1689889583\" /></span><br><br><strong>Key features:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>8-10 hours of gameplay.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Main story divided into 8 chapters.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>8 kingdoms to explore.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Quick turn-based battles.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>There are no random encounters. Enemies are always visible.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Resources can be collected.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Objects can be created.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Teacher System.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>100 spells to learn.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>100 weapons to discover.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>40 armors to discover.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>150 recipes to learn.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>7 professions to learn.</li></ul>",
